{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Bless</b> — He mentioned the first [blessing] because [the soul] is obligated to bless Him on account of His honor, and the second on account of His having done good to him, as he stated: <b>do not forget all His benefits</b>, which He has benefited you. Or he mentioned [it] twice [meaning] time after time and moment after moment."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 103, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:55.348270657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}